data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### aave-v3@3.6.0::Setup::_setUp\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/invariants/Setup.t.sol#L29-L82\n\n```\nusing MarketReportUtils for MarketReport;\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::WrappedTokenGatewayTests::aaveOracle\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/helpers/WrappedTokenGateway.t.sol#L16-L50\n\n```\nAaveOracle internal aaveOracle;\nWrappedTokenGatewayV3 internal wrappedTokenGatewayV3;\nAToken internal aWEth;\nVariableDebtToken internal wEthVariableDebtToken;\nAToken internal aUsdx;\nVariableDebtToken internal usdxVariableDebtToken;\nuint256 internal depositSize = 5e18;\n+2 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### be820cee-03b3-5be6-89fe-762ac26252ff\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/docs/3.7/Aave-v3.7-changelog.md#L3-L3\n\n```\nAave v3.7 Changelog › Core Contracts\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::MarketReportUtils::__contract__~2\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/src/deployments/contracts/utilities/MarketReportUtils.sol#L7-L28\n\n```\ntoContractsReport(\n    MarketReport memory report\n  ) internal pure returns (ContractsReport memory contractsReport) {\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::BatchTestProcedures::DeployCoreAndPeripheryVariables\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02